00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.000
Knowledge, reasoning, maths.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:44.000
So to check these things, there are some generic data sets, benchmarks, with the help of which you do these evaluations.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:56.000
But at the same time, if you want to measure the performance of LLM for your custom application, then you have to run custom model evals for it.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:18:06.000
Basically, you run LLMs on your data, on your application and you understand which is the best model for your application.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:11.000
